Promise fields: state, target, selector, arguments, result, error, startedAt, finishedAt, timeoutMs.
initialize: set idle state and clear outcome.
send:selector:arguments:timeoutMs: validate and start one asynchronous message; return self immediately.
send:selector:arguments: use a thirty-second reply deadline.
state, target, selector, arguments, error: return the named field.
ready: report whether fulfilled or rejected.
result: return fulfilled value; signal pending or rejection otherwise.
await / await: wait for settlement within the chosen deadline, then return result or propagate failure. Waiting timeout leaves the operation running.
